<title>BAHRAIN: Aluminium Bahrain chief moves to oil ministry.</title>
<headline>Aluminium Bahrain chief moves to oil ministry.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gudvin Tofte, the former chief executive of Aluminium Bahrain (Alba), has been appointed senior adviser at Bahrain's Oil and Industry Ministry, an Alba statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said Tofte now held the post of senior adviser to Oil and Industry Minister Sheikh Isa bin Ali al-Khalifa, who also is chairman of Alba, the Middle East's biggest aluminium producer.</p>
<p>Former deputy chief executive Karim Salimi has been appointed acting chief executive of Alba.</p>
<p>--Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
